config ROSE
	bool "RoSE co-simulation bridge adapter driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_UCBBAR_ROSEADAPTER_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the driver for the RoSE co-simulation bridge adapter
	  (compatible "ucbbar,RoseAdapter"). Provides a device-model API
	  (rose_tx / rose_rx) over the adapter's TX/RX FIFOs. This initial
	  version is polling-only; DMA + interrupt support is added later.
